  "rerun": "re-derive with the O0 serial timing log before any timed comparison (B-6)",
  "runtime_skips": "the suite's only runtime skip site (static AST census of every test module: PrivateDocumentationContractTests.setUpClass raises SkipTest(PRIVATE_TIER_SKIP_REASON) when the ignored private tier is absent); decorator skips are not listed because the canonical enumeration computes them",
  "outputs_dependency": "the lab weights predate two changes: batch A routes the test-side whole-checkout walks (monitor_writer_quiesce_workflow *.py, test_case_repository test_*.py, project_contracts 02-AIR-devices_config.csv, ztp_monitor_watch_runtime_workflow *.service/*.timer) through governed_tree_paths, which never enters outputs/, .codex* or .agents, and http-test outputs/ moved out of the main tree (2026-10-24); their cost no longer depends on outputs/ content, so the lab weights of those modules may be overestimated; re-derive from a timing log taken on the integrated tree (O0 or a sharded diagnostic run) before any timed comparison",
  "leftover_allowlist": "of the ignored-file shapes S0 lanes and the serial armG run left (611 files, 4 shapes, equal in both) the two outputs/test-diagnostics fixture trees (collector-prefix-feedback-*, download-parent-red-*) are reviewed: after batch A no test-side whole-checkout walk enters outputs/, the serial source discovery skips it, and the runner never accepts *.py/*.sh/*.cgi/*.service/*.timer/02-AIR-devices_config.csv leftovers outside its non-source roots (F6); a static census of production code (156 files) found only walks that cannot observe these entries.  .deployment.lock and monitor/.generate-monitor-html.lock are read through product packaging (test_upload_package_contract walks the checkout and asserts the monitor lock is not packaged; serial creates it before that test, its lane may not), so a sharded run needs both lock files to exist in the main checkout beforehand.  Static census of test_cases/*.py: no test lists or globs a temporary root; indirect traversal through product code is censused for outputs/ only"
